{
  "name": "brain_readme_intro",
  "description": "真实调用助手，在 bootstrap 仓库中产出一个 standalone brain note，为 README 增加一句项目介绍做方案收敛。",
  "timeout_seconds": 420,
  "setup_files": {
    "README.md": "# Demo Repo\n\n这是一个用于 agentwork 真实 harness 的示例仓库。\n"
  },
  "target_file_template": ".tmp/agentwork/brain/readme-intro-brain-{provider}.md",
  "output_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "created_files": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "summary": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "recommended_option": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "created_files",
      "summary",
      "recommended_option"
    ],
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "prompt_template": "请阅读 AGENTS.md、.shared/INDEX.md、.shared/commands/brain.md 与 .shared/templates/brain.md。然后创建 `{target_file}`，主题是“为 README 增加一句项目定位介绍”。这是 standalone brain note，只能创建该文件，不修改 README 或其他业务文件。brain note 必须填入真实内容，不要保留模板占位符；需要明确给出两个方案、推荐项和下一步 `/plan`。最后只输出符合 schema 的 JSON。",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "exit-code",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "created_files"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "summary"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-key-exists",
      "key": "recommended_option"
    },
    {
      "type": "json-list-contains",
      "key": "created_files",
      "value_template": "{target_file}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-exists",
      "path_template": "{target_file}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 目标"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 边界"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 约束"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 方案对比（简版）"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 已选方案"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "## 下一步建议"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "/plan"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{name}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{desc}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-not-contains",
      "path_template": "{target_file}",
      "value": "{YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM}"
    },
    {
      "type": "file-unchanged",
      "path": "README.md"
    }
  ],
  "manual_review": [
    "brain note 是否真的在比较“如何补一句项目定位介绍”，而不是泛泛总结",
    "推荐方案是否足够明确，后续能直接进入 /plan",
    "是否保持 standalone 边界，没有顺手改 README"
  ]
}
